<section class="phero"><div class="phero-bg"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator.webp 1024w" sizes="100vw" width="1024" height="603" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.15"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><i aria-hidden="true">/</i><span aria-current="page">Free tools</span></nav><p class="kicker">Free &amp; private</p><h1>Free Insurance Claim Calculators for Idaho Owners</h1><p class="lede">7 calculators and planners drawn from real appraisal work. Use them to understand your claim, check the insurer’s math and plan next steps. No sign-up, nothing stored.</p></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="tgrid" data-stagger><a class="tcard rv" href="/policy-math-tools/claim-gap-net-estimator/"><span class="tcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="603" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="tcard-k">Calculator</span></span><span class="tcard-b"><h2>Claim Gap &amp; Net Recovery Estimator</h2><p>Size the dispute, project an award and see your net after appraiser and umpire fees at three landing points.</p></span></a><a class="tcard rv" href="/policy-math-tools/rcv-acv-holdback-calculator/"><span class="tcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/paperwork.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/paperwork-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/paperwork.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="641" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="tcard-k">Calculator</span></span><span class="tcard-b"><h2>RCV vs. ACV Holdback Calculator</h2><p>Estimate the first actual-cash-value check, the depreciation held back and the total after repairs.</p></span></a><a class="tcard rv" href="/policy-math-tools/roof-pitch-squares-calculator/"><span class="tcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roof-shingles.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roof-shingles-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roof-shingles.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="526" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="tcard-k">Calculator</span></span><span class="tcard-b"><h2>Roof Pitch &amp; Squares Calculator</h2><p>Turn a footprint into true roof squares with pitch and waste, then compare against the carrier’s count.</p></span></a><a class="tcard rv" href="/policy-math-tools/percentage-deductible-calculator/"><span class="tcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/thunderstorm.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/thunderstorm-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/thunderstorm.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="tcard-k">Calculator</span></span><span class="tcard-b"><h2>Percentage Deductible Calculator</h2><p>See a percentage wind/hail deductible in dollars, the damage threshold for any payment and a 0.5–5% ladder.</p></span></a><a class="tcard rv" href="/policy-math-tools/idaho-claim-timeline-builder/"><span class="tcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/laptop-docs.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/laptop-docs-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/laptop-docs.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="638" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="tcard-k">Planner</span></span><span class="tcard-b"><h2>Idaho Claim Timeline Builder</h2><p>Map notice, proof-of-loss, appraiser, holdback and suit dates from your loss date, then export to a calendar.</p></span></a><a class="tcard rv" href="/policy-math-tools/appraisal-readiness-checkup/"><span class="tcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/clipboard.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/clipboard-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/clipboard.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="680" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="tcard-k">Checklist</span></span><span class="tcard-b"><h2>Appraisal Readiness Checkup</h2><p>Twelve yes/no questions that score your claim file and build a personal to-do list before you demand appraisal.</p></span></a><a class="tcard rv" href="/policy-math-tools/roof-snow-load-estimator/"><span class="tcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/icicles.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/icicles-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/icicles.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="685" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="tcard-k">Estimator</span></span><span class="tcard-b"><h2>Roof Snow Load Estimator</h2><p>Estimate the weight of snow, ice and rain on your roof and compare it with the design load. Built for Idaho winters.</p></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap faq-in"><div class="rv"><p class="kicker dark">Suggested order</p><h2>Using the tools together</h2><ol class="steps-ol"><li>Start with the <a href="/policy-math-tools/idaho-claim-timeline-builder/">claim timeline builder</a> so no deadline slips.</li><li>Check the roof math with the <a href="/policy-math-tools/roof-pitch-squares-calculator/">roof squares calculator</a>, or the weight on it with the <a href="/policy-math-tools/roof-snow-load-estimator/">snow load estimator</a>.</li><li>See what you’re actually owed with the <a href="/policy-math-tools/percentage-deductible-calculator/">percentage deductible</a> and <a href="/policy-math-tools/rcv-acv-holdback-calculator/">RCV vs. ACV</a> calculators.</li><li>Size the dispute with the <a href="/policy-math-tools/claim-gap-net-estimator/">claim gap estimator</a>.</li><li>Finish with the <a href="/policy-math-tools/appraisal-readiness-checkup/">readiness checkup</a>.</li></ol></div><div class="rv"><div class="box box-call"><h2 class="box-t">Talk it through, free</h2><p>A short call tells you whether appraisal fits your claim, or whether something else would serve you better.</p><a class="big-tel" href="tel:+18445371427">+1 (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-y full" href="/schedule-a-consult/">Send claim details</a><small>Mon–Fri 8am–6pm MT</small></div></div></div></section>
</main>
